msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"I'd like to introduce you to somebody, Granny. This here is my employee, "
"Mr..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Kazuma Kiryu. I work for the president."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "My, Masahiko must certainly keep you busy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Masahiko?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Hey, what's wrong with you, Kiryu-kun? Forgot my first name, eh? Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "(You could have told me...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"I'm Masahiko's grandmother, Shizu. You'll be giving me a tour of Kamurocho "
"today, hmm? How exciting!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "But, my goodness... don't businessmen wear ties these days?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Actually..."
msgstr "In realtà..."

msgctxt "292"
msgid "We try not to use our air conditioner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Ah, yes, to conserve energy in summer. That's a popular idea nowadays. But "
"in winter? Aren't you cold, dear?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Yes, even in winter. Our president is very ecologically-minded."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Come to think of it, even the prime minister goes without a tie now and "
"again..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Our president hates ties, so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Oh, yes! He's preferred street-punk clothing styles since he was little. It "
"must be very trying for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Well, he asked me kind of out of the blue... I had no time to change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Asked you...? Why would you change your clothes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"Ahem! That's... that's because Kiryu-kun here is actually on vacation! He "
"came here because the company president asked him to!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Oh, dear, I'm sorry my grandson is so demanding of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"It's so hard for me to imagine this boy running a company headquartered in "
"such a big, impressive building!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Hehehe. I've been working hard here in Tokyo, Granny!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"How about you show me around the office, then? I'd love to meet all of your "
"employees."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Well, about that... Um... Kiryu-kun?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "They have the day off today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Oh, is that so? What a laid-back company you have there, Masahiko!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "There was an accident, and now it's off limits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"You see that kind of thing on the TV sometimes. Tokyo can be such a "
"dangerous place..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "I'm afraid the building is open to authorized personnel only."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"Authorized personnel? But isn't Masahiko's company in there? He's authorized"
" enough!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"But you couldn't go in, Granny! There've been bomb threats and explosions. "
"Even our closest relatives aren't allowed in!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"What a bother! Bomb threats and such... Tokyo really is a terribly dangerous"
" place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"Say, Granny, you must be hungry! Why don't we go to my favorite yakiniku "
"place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Yes... yes, why not? Go ahead and show me the way, sweetie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "We try not to use A/C."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "Our president hates ties."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "I had no time to change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "They have the day off today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "It's off-limits due to an accident."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Authorized personnel only."
msgstr ""

